# MainWindow.xaml.cs
· 没有任何联网代码，源码可以逐行审查。\n
=> · No networking code at all; the source code can be reviewed line by line.\n

# MainWindow.xaml.cs
· 不装服务、不加开机启动、不常驻后台，关闭窗口即完全退出。\n
=> · No services, no startup entries, nothing running in the background. Closing the window fully exits the app.\n

# MainWindow.xaml.cs
· 所有删除都先列出明细，确认后才执行。\n
=> · Every deletion lists the details first and runs only after you confirm.\n

# MainWindow.xaml.cs
· 启动项只做“禁用/启用”，和任务管理器用的是同一套开关；只有指向程序已不存在的失效项才允许删除。\n
=> · Startup items are only disabled/enabled, using the same switch as Task Manager; only broken items whose program no longer exists can be deleted.\n

# MainWindow.xaml.cs
· 卸载调用软件自带的卸载程序；残留文件夹移到回收站，注册表先备份成 .reg。\n
=> · Uninstall runs the app's own uninstaller; leftover folders go to the Recycle Bin and registry keys are backed up to .reg first.\n

# MainWindow.xaml.cs
· 内存优化只列出你自己运行的软件，不碰系统进程；不做“一键清理内存”这种只是把内存挪到硬盘的操作。\n
=> · Memory optimization lists only apps you started yourself and never touches system processes; no "one-click memory cleanup" that just pushes memory to disk.\n

# MainWindow.xaml.cs
· 文件去重以 MD5 为准，删除前重新校验；联网控制只用 Windows 防火墙和 QoS 策略，不装驱动；右键菜单只隐藏不删除；文件粉碎要二次确认，系统和软件目录不允许粉碎。\n
=> · Duplicate Finder relies on MD5 and re-verifies before deleting; Network Control uses only Windows Firewall and QoS policies, no drivers; context menu items are only hidden, never deleted; File Shredder asks twice and refuses system and program folders.\n

# MainWindow.xaml.cs
· 病毒防护不自带病毒库，用的是 Windows 自带的 Microsoft Defender。\n
=> · Virus Protection has no virus definitions of its own; it uses Microsoft Defender built into Windows.\n

