# Pages/Tools/ShredTool.xaml
先用随机数据把文件内容覆盖掉并写入磁盘，再改成随机文件名删除，恢复软件找不回内容和文件名。粉碎后无法恢复，也不会进回收站。
=> First overwrites the file contents with random data and flushes it to disk, then renames the file randomly and deletes it, so recovery software can't recover the contents or the file name. Shredded files can't be recovered and don't go to the Recycle Bin.

# Pages/Tools/ShredTool.xaml
注意：固态硬盘（SSD）会把写入挪到别的位置，覆盖不能保证旧数据在硬件上被擦掉；系统还原点、文件历史记录、网盘里的副本也不会被粉碎。系统和软件目录里的文件不允许粉碎。
=> Note: SSDs remap writes to other locations, so overwriting can't guarantee old data is erased from the hardware. Copies in System Restore points, File History or cloud storage are not shredded either. Files in system and program folders can't be shredded.

