# v2.5
 · 精确模式
=>  · Precise mode

以管理员身份运行时使用精确模式：通过 Windows 的事件跟踪（ETW，资源监视器用的也是它）接收每一次联网，很短的连接和 DNS 查询这类 UDP 数据也能记到。记录只在这个页面开着时进行，离开页面就停止，不会在后台运行。如果本程序在记录途中意外关闭（比如程序出错或被强制结束），请再以管理员身份打开一次本程序，它会关掉留在 Windows 里的记录。
=> Running as administrator, so precise mode is used: every connection is received through Windows event tracing (ETW, the same source Resource Monitor uses), so even very short connections and UDP traffic such as DNS lookups are recorded. Recording only runs while this page is open and stops when you leave it; nothing runs in the background. If this program closes unexpectedly while recording (for example, it crashes or is force-closed), open it again as administrator once and it will stop the recording left behind in Windows.

精确模式没能启动（错误代码 {0}），已改为每秒查看一次连接表。不到一秒就断开的连接可能记不到；只记录 TCP 连接。记录只在这个页面开着时进行，离开页面就停止。
=> Precise mode couldn't start (error code {0}), so the connection table is checked every second instead. Connections that last less than a second may be missed, and only TCP connections are recorded. Recording only runs while this page is open and stops when you leave it.


